  "label": "The dishwasher is mapped to the man",
  "description": "The text 'him: the dishwasher is acting weird' maps the dishwasher (an appliance) onto the man in the image. The man is visually depicted performing a domestic task (chopping vegetables), which is humorously attributed to the dishwasher. This mapping relies on the visual of the man chopping vegetables to represent the 'weird' behavior of the dishwasher, creating an absurd analogy where the appliance is 'acting' like a person (specifically, a man) doing a task.",
